{"id":"dran","lemma":"dran","pos":"adv","rank":278,"glosses":["to be in a particular situation","to be (possibly) true","to be someone's turn (in a game, to do household chores, etc.)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/f0/De-dran.ogg/De-dran.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Bin ich zu früh dran?","en":"Am I too early?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/250024","words":[{"g":"am","l":"sein"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"early"},null]},{"text":"Deine Freunde sind spät dran.","en":"Your friends are late.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/757968","words":[{"g":"your","l":"dein"},{"g":"friends"},{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"late"},null]},{"text":"Fast alle waren spät dran.","en":"Almost everyone was late.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/567088","words":[{"g":"almost"},{"g":"all, everyone"},{"g":"to be","l":"sein"},{"g":"late"},null]},{"text":"Jetzt bist du dran.","en":"Now you do it.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/50381","words":[{"g":"now"},{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"you"},null]},{"text":"Ich bin ein bisschen spät dran.","en":"I'm a bit late.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"sein"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"bit"},{"g":"late"},null]}]}